Modifications made by Query Farm LLC relative to the upstream project:

  - Go module path renamed from github.com/duckdb/duckdb-go-bindings to
    github.com/Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn-go-bindings.
  - The native library modules (one per platform, packaged by
    internal/cmd/brood) are built from the Haybarn engine's GitHub Releases
    (Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn) instead of DuckDB's, and published under the
    Haybarn origin named in duckdb-release.json. They carry
    libhaybarn_static.a, the Haybarn engine build, which embeds the single
    Haybarn extension trust root and the haybarn-extensions.query.farm core and
    community extension repository URLs. DuckDB-signed extensions do not load.
  - The cgo linker flag -lduckdb_static is correspondingly -lhaybarn_static,
    and the shared-library build links -lhaybarn. All other archive names
    (extensions, capabilities), the C API headers (duckdb.h,
    duckdb_static_extension.h) and the duckdb_ C symbol surface are preserved
    unchanged for ABI compatibility with upstream DuckDB.
  - Documentation and CI repointed at the Haybarn org.
